  m_text: 'One folder looks slightly different from the others: its file, the side
    of its tab, a small tilt or its size. Click it to finish the round.


    <b>Careful:</b>
    clicking a wrong folder adds pressure.


    The meter fills at a steady speed
    until the round is done.'
